      <li><strong>Torsion spring replacement</strong> — roughly $150 to $350 installed, typically same-day, and swapped as a pair.</li>
      <li><strong>New opener installed</strong> — about $350 to $600 depending on the drive type.</li>
      <li><strong>Full door replacement</strong> — around $900 to $2,500 for a standard two-car door, and more once you're into oversized shop and barn doors.</li>
